# Efficient capture of C2H2 from CO2 and CnH4 by a novel fluorinated anion pillared MOF with flexible molecular sieving effect

Efficient capture of $\mathrm{C}_{2}\mathrm{H}_{2}$ from $\mathbf{CO}_{2}$ and $\mathrm{C}_{n}\mathrm{H}_{4}$ by a novel fluorinated anion pillared MOF with flexible molecular sieving effect
